 1</dt>\n<dd><p>This is a definition item\nWith a paragraph</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This is a block quote</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a list</li>\n<li>with an item2</li>\n</ul>\n<pre><code class=\"language-java\">Test\n\n\n</code></pre>\n<p>And a last line</p>\n</dd>\n<dd>This ia another definition item</dd>\n<dt>Term2</dt>\n<dt>Term3 <em>with some inline</em></dt>\n<dd>This is another definition for term2</dd>\n</dl>\n","text":"<dl>\n<dt>Term 1</dt>\n<dd>This is a definition item\nWith a paragraph\nThis is a block quote\nThis is a list\nwith an item2\nTest\n\n\nAnd a last line\n</dd>\n<dd>This ia another definition item</dd>\n<dt>Term2</dt>\n<dt>Term3 with some inline</dt>\n<dd>This is another definition for term2</dd>\n</dl>\n"},{"s":"DefinitionListSpecs Example 2","md":"Term 1\n\n:   Definition\nwith lazy continuation.\n\n    Second paragraph of the definition.","filee":"<dl>\n<dt>Term 1</dt>\n<dd><p>Definition\nwith lazy continuation.</p>\n<p>Second paragraph of the definition.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n","text":"<dl>\n<dt>Term 1</dt>\n<dd>Definition\nwith lazy continuation.\nSecond paragraph of the definition.\n</dd>\n</dl>\n"},{"s":"DefinitionListSpecs Example 3","md":"Term 1\n:  Invalid with less than 3 characters","filee":"<p>Term 1\n:  Invalid with less than 3 characters</p>\n","text":"Term 1\n:  Invalid with less than 3 characters\n"},{"s":"DefinitionListSpecs Example 4","md":"Term 1\n   : Valid even if `:` starts at most 3 spaces","filee":"<dl>\n<dt>Term 1</dt>\n<dd>Valid even if <code>:</code> starts at most 3 spaces</dd>\n</dl>\n","text":"<dl>\n<dt>Term 1</dt>\n<dd>Valid even if : starts at most 3 spaces</dd>\n</dl>\n"},{"s":"DefinitionListSpecs Example 5","md":"Term 1\n\n    : Not valid","filee":"<p>Term 1</p>\n<pre><code>: Not valid\n</code></pre>\n","text":"Term 1\n: Not valid\n"},{"s":"DefinitionListSpecs Example 6","md":"1.  First\n    \n2.  Second\n    \n    Term 1\n    :   Definition\n    \n    Term 2\n    :   Second Definition","filee":"<ol>\n<