,"filee":"<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>header</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>:x:</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","text":"header :x: "},{"s":"EmojiSpecs Example 6","md":"| header |\n|--------|\n|:x:|","filee":"<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>header</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>:x:</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","text":"header :x: "},{"s":"EmphasisExtraSpecs Example 1","md":"The following text ~~is deleted~~","filee":"<p>The following text <del>is deleted</del></p>\n","text":"The following text is deleted\n"},{"s":"EmphasisExtraSpecs Example 2","md":"H~2~O is a liquid. 2^10^ is 1024","filee":"<p>H<sub>2</sub>O is a liquid. 2<sup>10</sup> is 1024</p>\n","text":"H2O is a liquid. 210 is 1024\n"},{"s":"EmphasisExtraSpecs Example 3","md":"One quintillionth can be expressed as 10^-18^\n\nDaggers^\u2020^ and double-daggers^\u2021^ can be used to denote notes. Plus signs^+^ and entity plus signs^&plus;^ can be used in superscript and subscript: H~+~ and H~&plus;~.","filee":"<p>One quintillionth can be expressed as 10<sup>-18</sup></p>\n<p>Daggers<sup>\u2020</sup> and double-daggers<sup>\u2021</sup> can be used to denote notes. Plus signs<sup>+</sup> and entity plus signs<sup>+</sup> can be used in superscript and subscript: H<sub>+</sub> and H<sub>+</sub>.</p>\n","text":"One quintillionth can be expressed as 10-18\nDaggers\u2020 and double-daggers\u2021 can be used to denote notes. Plus signs+ and entity plus signs+ can be used in superscript and subscript: H+ and H+.\n"},{"s":"EmphasisExtraSpecs Example 4","md":"++Inserted text++","filee":"<p><ins>Inserted text</ins></p>\n","text":"Inserted text\n"},{"s":"EmphasisExtraSpecs Example 5","md":"==Marked text==","filee":"<p><mark>Marked text</mark></p>\n","text":"Marked text\n"},{"s":"EmphasisExtraSpecs Example 6","md":"This is text MyBrand ^&reg;^ and MyTrademark ^&trade;^\nThis is text MyBrand^&reg;^ and MyTrademark^&trade;^\nThis is text MyBrand ~&reg;~ and MyCopyright ^&copy;^","filee":"<p>This is text MyBrand <sup>\u00ae</sup> and MyTrademark <sup>\u2122</sup>\nThis is text MyBrand^\u00ae^ and MyTrademark^\u2122^\nThis is text MyBrand <sub>\u00ae</sub> and MyCopyright <sup>\u00a9</sup></p>\n","text":"This is text MyBrand \u00ae and MyTrademark \u2122\nThis is text MyBrand^\u00ae^ and MyTrademark^\u2122^\nThis is text MyBrand \u00ae and MyCopyright \u00a9\n"},{"s":"FigureFooterAndCiteSpecs Example 1","md":"^^^\nThis is a figure\n^^^ This is a *caption*","filee":"<figure>\n<p>This is a figure</p>\n<figcaption>This is a <em>caption</em></figcaption>\n</figure>\n","text":"<figure>\nThis is a figure\n<figcaption>This is a caption</figcaption>\n</figure>\n"},{"s":"FigureFooterAndCiteSpecs Example 2","md":"^^ This is a footer\n^^ multi-line","filee":"<footer>This is a footer\nmulti-line</footer>\n","text":"<footer>This is a footer\nmulti-line</footer>\n"},{"s":"FigureFooterAndCiteSpecs Example 3","md":"This is a \"\"citation of someone\"\"","filee":"<p>This is a <cite>citation of someone</cite></p>\n","text":"This is a citation of someone\n"},{"s":"FootnotesSpecs Example 1","md":"Here is a footnote reference,[^1] and another.[^longnote]\n\nThis is another reference to [^1]\n\n[^1]: Here is the footnote.\n\nAnd another reference to [^longnote]\n\n[^longnote]: Here's one with multiple blocks.\n\n    Subsequent paragraphs are indented to show that they\nbelong to the previous footnote.\n\n    > This is a block quote\n    > Inside a footnote\n\n        { some.code }\n\n    The whole paragraph can be indented, or just the first\n    line.  In this way, multi-paragraph footnotes work like\n    multi-paragraph list items.\n\nThis paragraph won't be part of the note, because it\nisn't indented.","filee":"<p>Here is a footnote reference,<a id=\"fnref:1\" href=\"#fn:1\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>1</sup></a> and another.<a id=\"fnref:3\" href=\"#fn:2\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>2</sup></a></p>\n<p>This is another reference to <a id=\"fnref:2\" href=\"#fn:1\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>1</sup></a></p>\n<p>And another reference to <a id=\"fnref:4\" href=\"#fn:2\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>2</sup></a></p>\n<p>This paragraph won't be part of the note, because it\nisn't indented.</p>\n<div class=\"footnotes\">\n<hr />\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn:1\">\n<p>Here is the footnote.<a href=\"#fnref:1\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a><a href=\"#fnref:2\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:2\">\n<p>Here's one with multiple blocks.</p>\n<p>Subsequent paragraphs are indented to show that they\nbelong to the previous footnote.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This is a block quote\nInside a footnote</p>\n</blockquote>\n<pre><code>{ some.code }\n</code></pre>\n<p>The whole paragraph can be indented, or just the first\nline.  In this way, multi-paragraph footnotes work like\nmulti-paragraph list items.<a href=\"#fnref:3\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a><a href=\"#fnref:4\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n","text":"Here is a footnote reference,<a id=\"fnref:1\" href=\"#fn:1\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>1</sup></a> and another.<a id=\"fnref:3\" href=\"#fn:2\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>2</sup></a>\nThis is another reference to <a id=\"fnref:2\" href=\"#fn:1\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>1</sup></a>\nAnd another reference to <a id=\"fnref:4\" href=\"#fn:2\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>2</sup></a>\nThis paragraph won't be part of the note, because it\nisn't indented.\n<div class=\"footnotes\">\n<hr />\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn:1\">\nHere is the footnote.<a href=\"#fnref:1\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a><a href=\"#fnref:2\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:2\">\nHere's one with multiple blocks.\nSubsequent paragraphs are indented to show that they\nbelong to the previous footnote.\nThis is a block quote\nInside a footnote\n{ some.code }\nThe whole paragraph can be indented, or just the first\nline.  In this way, multi-paragraph footnotes work like\nmulti-paragraph list items.<a href=\"#fnref:3\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a><a href=\"#fnref:4\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n"},{"s":"FootnotesSpecs Example 2","md":"Here is a footnote[^1]. And another one[^2]. And a third one[^3]. And a fourth[^4].\n\n[^1]: Footnote 1 text\n\n[^2]: Footnote 2 text\n\na\n\n[^3]: Footnote 3 text\n\n[^4]: Footnote 4 text","filee":"<p>Here is a footnote<a id=\"fnref:1\" href=\"#fn:1\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>1</sup></a>. And another one<a id=\"fnref:2\" href=\"#fn:2\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>2</sup></a>. And a third one<a id=\"fnref:3\" href=\"#fn:3\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>3</sup></a>. And a fourth<a id=\"fnref:4\" href=\"#fn:4\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>4</sup></a>.</p>\n<p>a</p>\n<div class=\"footnotes\">\n<hr />\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn:1\">\n<p>Footnote 1 text<a href=\"#fnref:1\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:2\">\n<p>Footnote 2 text<a href=\"#fnref:2\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:3\">\n<p>Footnote 3 text<a href=\"#fnref:3\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:4\">\n<p>Footnote 4 text<a href=\"#fnref:4\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n","text":"Here is a footnote<a id=\"fnref:1\" href=\"#fn:1\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>1</sup></a>. And another one<a id=\"fnref:2\" href=\"#fn:2\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>2</sup></a>. And a third one<a id=\"fnref:3\" href=\"#fn:3\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>3</sup></a>. And a fourth<a id=\"fnref:4\" href=\"#fn:4\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>4</sup></a>.\na\n<div class=\"footnotes\">\n<hr />\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn:1\">\nFootnote 1 text<a href=\"#fnref:1\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:2\">\nFootnote 2 text<a href=\"#fnref:2\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:3\">\nFootnote 3 text<a href=\"#fnref:3\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:4\">\nFootnote 4 text<a href=\"#fnref:4\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n"},{"s":"FootnotesSpecs Example 3","md":"Here is a footnote[^1]. And another one[^2]. And a third one[^3]. And a fourth[^4].\n\n[^1]: Footnote 1 text\n[^2]: Footnote 2 text\n[^3]: Footnote 3 text\n[^4]: Footnote 4 text","filee":"<p>Here is a footnote<a id=\"fnref:1\" href=\"#fn:1\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>1</sup></a>. And another one<a id=\"fnref:2\" href=\"#fn:2\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>2</sup></a>. And a third one<a id=\"fnref:3\" href=\"#fn:3\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>3</sup></a>. And a fourth<a id=\"fnref:4\" href=\"#fn:4\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>4</sup></a>.</p>\n<div class=\"footnotes\">\n<hr />\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn:1\">\n<p>Footnote 1 text<a href=\"#fnref:1\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:2\">\n<p>Footnote 2 text<a href=\"#fnref:2\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:3\">\n<p>Footnote 3 text<a href=\"#fnref:3\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:4\">\n<p>Footnote 4 text<a href=\"#fnref:4\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n","text":"Here is a footnote<a id=\"fnref:1\" href=\"#fn:1\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>1</sup></a>. And another one<a id=\"fnref:2\" href=\"#fn:2\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>2</sup></a>. And a third one<a id=\"fnref:3\" href=\"#fn:3\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>3</sup></a>. And a fourth<a id=\"fnref:4\" href=\"#fn:4\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>4</sup></a>.\n<div class=\"footnotes\">\n<hr />\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn:1\">\nFootnote 1 text<a href=\"#fnref:1\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:2\">\nFootnote 2 text<a href=\"#fnref:2\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:3\">\nFootnote 3 text<a href=\"#fnref:3\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn:4\">\nFootnote 4 text<a href=\"#fnref:4\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n"},{"s":"FootnotesSpecs Example 4","md":"- abc\n- def[^1]\n\n[^1]: Here is the footnote.","filee":"<ul>\n<li>abc</li>\n<li>def<a id=\"fnref:1\" href=\"#fn:1\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>1</sup></a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"footnotes\">\n<hr />\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn:1\">\n<p>Here is the footnote.<a href=\"#fnref:1\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n","text":"abc\ndef<a id=\"fnref:1\" href=\"#fn:1\" class=\"footnote-ref\"><sup>1</sup></a>\n<div class=\"footnotes\">\n<hr />\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn:1\">\nHere is the footnote.<a href=\"#fnref:1\" class=\"footnote-back-ref\">&#8617;</a>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n"},{"s":"GenericAttributesSpecs Example 1","md":"# This is a heading with an an attribute{#heading-link}\n\n# This is a heading # {#heading-link2}\n\n[This is a link](http://google.com){#a-link .myclass data-lang=fr data-value=\"This is a value\"}\n\nThis is a heading{#heading-link2}\n-----------------\n\nThis is a paragraph with an attached attributes {#myparagraph attached-bool-property attached-bool-property2}","filee":"<h1 id=\"heading-link\">This is a heading with an an attribute</h1>\n<h1 id=\"heading-link2\">This is a heading</h1>\n<p><a href=\"http://google.com\" id=\"a-link\" class=\"myclass\" data-lang=\"fr\" data-value=\"This is a value\">This is a link</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"heading-link2\">This is a heading</h2>\n<p id=\"myparagraph\" attached-bool-property=\"\" attached-bool-property2=\"\">This is a paragraph with an attached attributes </p>\n","text":"This is a heading with an an attribute\nThis is a heading\nThis is a link\nThis is a heading\nThis is a paragraph with an attached attributes \n"},{"s":"GenericAttributesSpecs Example 2","md":"{#fenced-id .fenced-class}\n~~~\nThis is a fenced with attached attributes\n~~~ ","filee":"<pre><code id=\"fenced-id\" class=\"fenced-class\">This is a fenced with attached attributes\n</code></pre>\n","text":"This is a fenced with attached attributes\n"},{"s":"GenericAttributesSpec